  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Smoothie_Mixer?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/12/Smoothie_Mixer.png/revision/latest?cb=20250925211208\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Smoothie Mixer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Smoothie Mixer\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Smoothie Mixer</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Machine</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 64</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 220,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  3 d</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 slot(s)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2×2</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 80</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Smoothie Mixer</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">production building</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 64. It is used to make <a href=\"/wiki/berry-smoothie-11417\" title=\"Berry Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">berry smoothies</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/green-smoothie-11418\" title=\"Green Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">green smoothies</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/yogurt-smoothie-11419\" title=\"Yogurt Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">yogurt smoothies</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/cucumber-smoothie-30754\" title=\"Cucumber Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cucumber smoothies</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/mixed-smoothie-24936\" title=\"Mixed Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mixed smoothies</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/cocoa-smoothie-29363\" title=\"Cocoa Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cocoa smoothies</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/plum-smoothie-29911\" title=\"Plum Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">plum smoothies</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/black-sesame-smoothie-31937\" title=\"Black Sesame Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">black sesame smoothies</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/tropical-smoothie-35569\" title=\"Tropical Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tropical smoothies</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Building</b></span></h3>\n<p>It costs 220,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> and takes 3 days or 80 <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> to build the Smoothie Mixer. It gives players 39 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> when completed.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p>The machine is a small pale yellow smoothie blender with a table of smootie cups and a barrel of apples and berries in the side.\n</p><p>The mastered version of this machine have some small golden parts on the metal on the barrel and the dispenser, along with a golden star under the blender's handle.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Products</b></span></h3>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/berry-smoothie-11417\" title=\"Berry smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Berry smoothie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/green-smoothie-11418\" title=\"Green smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green smoothie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/yogurt-smoothie-11419\" title=\"Yogurt smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Yogurt smoothie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/berry-smoothie-11417\" title=\"Berry Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Berry Smoothie</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/green-smoothie-11418\" title=\"Green Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Green Smoothie</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/yogurt-smoothie-11419\" title=\"Yogurt Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Yogurt Smoothie</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 64\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 66\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 70\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 h 15 min\n</td>\n<td>45 min\n</td>\n<td>1 h\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>★★★ 1 h 3 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 38 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 51 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>3<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>4<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>547<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>320<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>349<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>65<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>38<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element